              "units": 1.0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "audit_criteria",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Adjustment audit criteria",
          "items": [
            "SKU, unit, and location uniquely identify each line",
            "Pre-adjustment system quantity is retained",
            "Count and recount responsibilities are separated",
            "Open movements were considered before adjustment",
            "Reason code is supported by objective evidence",
            "Approval matches the adjustment authority",
            "System transaction agrees with authorized quantity",
            "Downstream orders and replenishment were considered",
            "Repeated patterns are routed without accusation",
            "Unresolved variances have owner and due point"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "audit_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Audit conclusion boundary",
          "guidance": "Record count facts, system references, and authorized reasons without assigning blame or alleging theft. Do not alter source transactions to force agreement. Follow applicable inventory, financial-control, privacy, and retention policy; route product restrictions, loss patterns, or accounting conclusions to the authorized reviewer."
        }
      ]
    },
